{"ticker":{"symbol":"017940.KS","name":"E1","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":81600.0,"change_pct":0.002457002457002533,"market_cap":471790878720.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.05575980392156863,"week52_low":75100.0,"week52_high":114500.0,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":318,"website":"https://www.e1.co.kr","business_summary":"E1 Corporation imports, stores, trades, and sells liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) in South Korea. The company transports LPG from oil-producing countries; and stores and manages LPG at Yeosu, Daesan, and Incheon terminals. It is also involved in the solar and wind power business; hydrogen charging business; electric vehicle charging business; investment activities; and digital technology and data-based business. In addition, the company offers Orange Cards; and Orange Plus, a charging station brand that combines LPG, hydrogen, and electric charging stations with vehicle-related convenience services. It also exports its products. E1 Corporation was founded in 1984 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"E1 Corporation은 한국에서 액화석유가스(LPG)를 수입, 저장, 거래, 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 산유국에서 LPG를 운송합니다. 여수, 대산, 인천 터미널에 LPG를 저장, 관리하고 있습니다. 또한 태양광 및 풍력 사업에도 참여하고 있습니다. 수소충전사업; 전기차충전사업; 투자 활동; 디지털 기술과 데이터 기반 비즈니스. 또한 회사는 오렌지 카드를 제공합니다. LPG, 수소, 전기 충전소에 차량 관련 편의 서비스를 결합한 충전소 브랜드 '오렌지 플러스'입니다. 또한 자사 제품을 수출합니다. E1 Corporation은 1984년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"정유","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":7990767897660.0,"operating_income":281605522000.0,"net_income":141859118470.0,"eps":24536.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":7827737066520.0,"operating_income":96965256140.0,"net_income":213182997950.0,"eps":36872.0},{"period":"2024","revenue